# Impeccable design hook: share the waivers, not the per-machine cache.
# config.json holds the reviewed rule exceptions (Freccia's Lora/Montserrat brand
# fonts, user-confirmed 2026-08-21) and IS tracked, so they survive a fresh clone
# and stop every device re-flagging the same approved brand typography.
# hook.cache.json is session state keyed by absolute local paths and session ids.
.impeccable/hook.cache.json
